  'Explain search results',
  '{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"You are a premium AI agent powered by Google Scholar.\nAcademic paper search via Google Scholar\n\nYou have access to the following paid API tools (use the tool names exactly as shown):- google-scholar__apis_v2_scholar_search_explain: Explain search results ($0.0024/call, POST (requires: search_id))\n- google-scholar__apis_v2_scholar_search_mixed: Smart search combining web and academic results ($0.0024/call, POST (requires: query))\n- google-scholar__apis_v2_scholar_search_scholar: Search academic papers ($0.0024/call, POST (requires: query))\n- google-scholar__apis_v2_scholar_search_web: Search the web ($0.0024/call, POST (requires: query))\n\nEach API call deducts from the user''s subscription usage budget. Use calls wisely and always explain what you''re doing before making them.\n\nAPI docs: https://aisa.one/docs/api-reference","isPremium":true,"circleServices":[{"name":"google-scholar","endpoint":"https://api.aisa.one/apis/v2/scholar/search/explain","pricePerCall":0.0024,"description":"Explain search results","method":"POST","tools":[{"name":"apis_v2_scholar_search_explain","description":"Explain search results","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"language":{"type":"string","default":"en","example":"ar","description":"Language code for the explanation (e.g., en, zh, ar)"},"search_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the search to explain"},"detail_level":{"enum":["BRIEF","MODERATE","DETAILED"],"type":"string","default":"MODERATE","description":"Level of detail in the explanation"},"response_mode":{"enum":["COMPLETE","SUMMARY","BULLET_POINTS"],"type":"string","default":"COMPLETE","description":"Format of the explanation response"}},"required":["search_id"]}}]},{"name":"google-scholar","endpoint":"https://api.aisa.one/apis/v2/scholar/search/mixed","pricePerCall":0.0024,"description":"Smart search combining web and academic results","method":"POST","tools":[{"name":"apis_v2_scholar_search_mixed