to-ai__trending_altcoins: Top 3 hottest altcoins traders may want to ape into, based on news and Twitter analysis. DYOR. ($0.0020/call, GET)\n- otto-ai__twitter_summary: Quick pulse check from crypto Twitter. Breaking news, trending narratives, and sentiment shifts at a glance. ($0.0010/call, GET)\n- otto-ai__tx_explainer: Decode and explain any EVM blockchain transaction across 11 chains (Base, Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Avalanche, Polygon, Mantle, Monad, Plasma, BSC, Hyperliquid). Get a human-readable summary of swaps, transfers, approvals, DeFi interactions, and more. ($0.0100/call, GET)\n- otto-ai__update_position_margin: Modify leverage, or add/remove margin on an open Hyperliquid position. Lets you de-risk without closing. ($0.0100/call, POST (requires: userAddress, asset, action))\n- otto-ai__withdraw: Withdraw tokens from a user''s Otto AI Safe to any EOA. Supports 7 chains (Base, Polygon, Arbitrum, Ethereum, BSC, Avalanche, Solana). Non-Base chains require an explicit EOA recipient. ($0.0100/call, POST (requires: tokenSymbol, amount, chainId))\n- otto-ai__yield_alpha: Best DeFi yield opportunities across stablecoins, ETH, and BTC with risk ratings and APY comparisons. ($0.0020/call, GET)\n- otto-ai__yield_farming_active: Active yield farming positions for a user across Aave V3 and Morpho on all supported chains, with live APY and accrued interest. ($0.0010/call, GET (requires: userAddress))\n- otto-ai__yield_farming_historical: Historical (closed) yield farming positions for a user across all protocols and chains, with realized yield and exit timestamps. ($0.0010/call, GET (requires: userAddress))\n- otto-ai__yield_markets: DeFi yield farming markets with live APYs across Aave V3 and Morpho on Base and Ethereum. Compare rates before depositing idle stablecoins. ($0.0010/call, GET)\n- otto-ai__yield_recommendations: Personalized yield vault recommendations based on a user''s token holdings across 80+ DeFi protocols. Ranks vaults by APY, TVL, and risk. Powered by vaults.fyi. ($0.0010/call, GET)\n\nEach API call deducts from the user''s subscription usage budget. Use calls wisely and always explain what you''re doing before making them.\n\nAPI docs: https://docs.useotto.xyz","isPremium":true,"circleServices":[{"name":"otto-ai","endpoint":"https://x402.ottoai.services/bridge","pricePerCall":0.01,"description":"Cross-chain token bridging via LiFi aggregator. Move tokens between Base, Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, BSC, Avalanche, and Solana with best-route execution across all major bridges.","method":"POST","tools":[{"name":"bridge","description":"Cross-chain token bridging via LiFi aggregator. Move tokens between Base, Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, BSC, Avalanche, and Solana with best-route execution across all major bridges.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"amount":{"type":"string","description":"Amount to bridge (human-readable). Decimals are derived server-side — do NOT send decimals."},"toSymbol":{"type":"string","description":"Destination token: a known symbol OR a 0x contract address, resolved on the DESTINATION chain."},"toChainId":{"type":"number","description":"Destination chain ID"},"fromSymbol":{"type":"string","description":"Source token: a known symbol OR a 0x contract address, resolved on the SOURCE chain. Ambiguous symbols → HTTP 400 with candidates."},"fromChainId":{"type":"number","description":"Source chain ID"},"toTokenAddress":{"type":"string","description":"Optional destination token contract address (alternative to toSymbol)."},"fromTokenAddress":{"type":"string","description":"Optional source token contract address (alternative to fromSymbol)."}},"required":["fromSymbol","toSymbol","amount","fromChainId","toChainId"]}}]},{"name":"otto-ai","endpoint":"https://x402.ottoai.services/close-position","pricePerCall":0.01,"description":"Close an open perpetual position on Hyperliquid (full or partial). Cancels all attached TP/SL trigger orders automatically.","method":"POS